  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4107.03 Calculating New Hampshire Sales",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4107.03 Calculating New Hampshire Sales. If direct sales data for New Hampshire are not available, sales may be estimated by prorating national or regional sales data by population.\n\nSource. #10527, eff 2-26-14 (from Env-A 4105.03); ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24",
